<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MiBeeVision on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/mibeevision/</link><description>Recent content in MiBeeVision on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/mibeevision/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MiBeeNvr 的自适应录像与存储设计</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-adaptive-recording-design/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-adaptive-recording-design/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;外界写 MiBeeNvr 自适应录像的文章，对机制的表述大多停在「动静感知、能省磁盘」这一层：靠什么信号判活、切换瞬间为什么不丢帧、对哪类相机会失效，很少讲透。这篇把这三层全部拆开：每个机制先白话、再上图、最后给参数，文末附完整术语表。机制描述基于 v0.13.0 文档与发布记录整理（2026-10）；版本演进的时间线见&lt;a href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/mibee-oss/mibee-nvr-v0.1-to-v0.12/"&gt;《MiBeeNvr：从 v0.1.0 到 v0.12.0》&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>